Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kehidupan cinta Yamada Kentaro\Nlancar-lancar saja sejauh ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi dia mentok di langkah terakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia belum sempat menyatakan cinta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak apa-apa, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah di sekolah atau sepulang sekolah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa telepon dia kapan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski jadwal liburan kami enggak cocok,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa pergi ke daerahnya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}cuma buat ngobrol sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma aku enggak bisa…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada banyak cara, sih, tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ada kesempatan lain kali…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menyimulasikan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}segala macam skenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi begitu mereka ketemu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia bahagia banget\Nsampai langsung lupa tujuannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.69,0:01:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, ini enggak bakal berhasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo, Nishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo… Ya, hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bisa ngobrol sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa kita ngobrol sebentar?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh, silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau memungkinkan…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan ke tempatmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa keluar sebentar, enggak?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngobrol langsung?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus bagaimana, nih?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melihat situasinya,\Nalasan wajar buat keluar…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}AKU MAU KE TOSERBA…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, agak susah, nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu. Masuk akal, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya, aku minta mendadak begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kelewat enggak sabar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.51,0:02:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku keringatan dan jantungku berdebar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menyedihkan banget.\NAda apa, sih, sama aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.63,0:02:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mentalku selemah ini, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan itu pernyataan cinta?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus bagaimana, nih?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku spontan menolak balasannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya aku enggak buru-buru begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mau ngobrol sama aku
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.13,0:03:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebenarnya bikin aku bahagia banget…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus bikin rencana yang pas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan jalani selangkah demi selangkah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum khawatir soal harus kasih\Nhadiah Hari Valentine atau enggak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku harus pastikan dia enggak benci aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lain kali, aku pasti bakal nyatakan cinta!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}You and I Are Polar Opposites\NSeason 2
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kamu sudah menunggu lama?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sama sekali enggak. Aku juga baru sampai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu. Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu baju baru, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku beli ini
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pas belanja bareng keluargaku
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}waktu Tahun Baru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manis banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, ayo ke toko dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tempatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mulai sadar aku ingin jadi pacarnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, aku lebih gelisah daripada sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga kami enggak ketemu\Norang yang kami kenal lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempat ini populer banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gapacho yang merekomendasikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gapachosan tahu banyak hal, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini enak banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.83,0:06:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}BERSERI-SERI…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manis banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin terus kasih kamu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.05,0:06:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}makanan enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pikir aku rakus, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luas banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya buku yang kamu sebutkan ada di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makasih sudah carikan buat aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bukunya banyak banget, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak tahu di mana letaknya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benaran banyak, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya buku yang belum pernah kulihat\Ndi toko buku dekat rumahku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tanya pramuniaga saja, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melihat-lihat buku yang belum pernah\Nkulihat, atau enggak niat beli,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sambil melihat sampul dan ringkasannya\Njuga seru banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.31,0:07:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak mengerti perasaan itu.\NKayak begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buku mahal itu baru saja terbit\Ndengan sampul tipis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kelihatan bahagia banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bagus, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}BERGEGAS PERGI…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu lihat orang yang kamu kenal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suzuki lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesaat, kupikir mereka\Nanak cowok dari kelas kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kayaknya orang asing, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tiba-tiba merinding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku enggak mau ketemu siapa pun\Nterus digodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita pindah ke toko lain, yuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak apa-apa, kok, benaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, di area ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita bisa ke sana, atau ke sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih banyak tempat lain buat dilihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau lihat waktunya,\Ntempat itu kayaknya lebih pas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}TERSIKSA…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tersiksa gara-gara ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bersikap mencurigakan banget\Nsampai bikin dia gelisah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Alasan aku enggak mau ada\Nyang lihat kami bareng…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Awalnya, itu karena aku\Nmerasa enggak cukup baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sekarang…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan soal pendapat orang lain\Ntentang aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma enggak mau rusak\Napa yang kami punya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga tahu aku mulai ingin lebih.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya aku meragukan\Nsikap atau perasaan Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetap saja,\Naku belum bisa sepenuhnya tenang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin bukti yang jelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kepagian, enggak, ya, beli ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Barang musiman lucu cepat habis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih baik beli sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bikin semua rencana itu\Nsama Honchan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kalau memang harus bilang\Ncepat atau lambat…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melihat jam malam Nishi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}perhentian berikutnya sudah yang terakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:09:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bakal ikuti rencana…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini agak jauh dari sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Di sebelah sana.\N- Aku suka kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang enggak terlalu spontan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}atau jago baca situasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku enggak sebego itu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sampai enggak sadar apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jujur saja,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku berharap dia yang bakal ngomong duluan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa aku juga agak perhitungan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetap saja, aku enggak cukup percaya diri\Nbuat menenangkan pikiranku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak bisa tahan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengatakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kamu lari?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya aku enggak tahan\Nsama kecanggungannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia dilecehkan? Dia baik-baik saja, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga… dia bakal bilang sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial, aku menyedihkan banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sebenarnya rencana
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bilang hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi pas aku kebanyakan mikir,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia duluan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku penasaran dia lagi mikir apa sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Aku mengatakannya.\N- Apa itu waktu yang salah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin harusnya aku enggak bilang tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yamada kelihatan kaget banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga aku enggak bikin dia enggak nyaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau aku salah paham?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meskipun dia pegang tanganku,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku tetap gelisah banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak bisa berhenti\Nmikir yang enggak-enggak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keheningan ini menyeramkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya aku enggak cocok\Nmikir berlebihan begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga suka kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, aku duluan yang suka sama kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski kamu duluan bilangnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku tetap ingin bilang dengan benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:12:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maukah kamu…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi pacarku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Timing-nya kurang pas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, jangan ketawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}MMH…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, kamu ketawa kebangetan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku coba tahan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi malah nangis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}EEE…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Indah banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini awalnya aku rencana jalan-jalan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sambil cari waktu yang pas\Ndengan pemandangan bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat suasananya tepat, kayak sekarang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku berniat bilang sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku payah banget hari ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi aku langsung bilang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makasih, ya, sudah memikirkan ini sedalam itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sudah memikirkan ini banget-banget\Ndemi aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah mikir seharian,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Bagaimana kalau ada orang dari sekolah\Nlihat terus godai kita?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Bukankah bakal canggung kalau itu terjadi?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku selalu khawatir hal yang enggak berguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus aku enggak tahan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu-satunya alasan\Nkita jalan bareng sekarang
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena kita "cuma teman".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak kayak kamu, aku selalu egois.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini, aku bahagia banget
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sampai enggak bisa tahan ekspresiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, enggak perlu minta maaf soal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:15:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, harus aku bilang bagaimana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak sabar buat bareng kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu formal banget tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan balas aku karena itu, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Layar ponselmu retak parah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok bisa begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lama enggak ketemu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.44,0:15:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu rahasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat Hari Valentine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, ada gambar di kuenya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya, ini agak enggak rapi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemajuannya dari tahun lalu keren banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seburuk itu, ya, tahun lalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nih, lihat, ini tahun lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Butuh nyali
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}cuma buat lihat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.51,0:16:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku usaha keras banget tahun ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu makan ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}semuanya bakal jadi indah,\Ndamai, hangat, serta penuh cinta dan impian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu seram, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu memasukkan sesuatu ke dalamnya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tani, dia kasih kamu makanan aneh, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kamu kelihatan cukup bahagia, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, jangan cueki aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Punyaku beli di toko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma menambahkan keping cokelat\Nterus kemas ulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bikin mufin ini bareng kakakku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakakmu yang paling banyak kerja, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, kita bagi-bagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yamada, ini buat kamu juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:16:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini cuma cokelat kewajiban!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya cokelat buat Yamada,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi enggak kubawa sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini salah paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak disangka istirahat makan siang\Njadi pesta bagi-bagi cokelat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bilang, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi meski kubawa,\Naku ingin kasih secara pribadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bilang saja, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai jumpa sepulang sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu menatap kelamaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Taira, kamu kerja hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, ini hari liburku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Aku ingin lihat kamu kerja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}T-Azuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wajah asliku sudah rusak\Nsampai enggak bisa dikenali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jumlahnya banyak banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa kayak Jutawan Jerami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah kasih punyamu ke Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti kukasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}MENATAP…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua kenapa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya kayak Hari Valentine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini lebih kayak pesta camilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa kayak makan camilan\Nbuat setahun hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus balas hadiahnya di White Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak bawa apa-apa,\Njadi aku cuma makan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira itu sesuatu\Nyang sudah disepakati para cewek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, semuanya cuma perhatian saja, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu lupa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah Kawasaki dan aku
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang aneh tahun lalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benaran lupa budaya itu ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan ngomong hal yang menyedihkan\Ndengan muka seceria itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku sudah makan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}harus kasih hadiah balasan enggak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus sebesar apa usahanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hadiah balasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, aku kasih kamu sesuatu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimanapun juga enggak masalah, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih baik daripada enggak dapat apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau permen karet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.19,0:19:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini Xylitol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau satu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.53,0:19:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat Hari Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu enggak adil!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku penasaran apa hadiah balasanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya, semua orang pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Honda pergi ke mana hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dah. Salam buat Yamada, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sibuk menanam bahan hari ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi aku pulang lebih awal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menanam bahan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kelihatan sibuk hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pergi setelah kelas wali kelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terimalah ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, kamu jago banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, kamu terlalu memuji, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah makan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku makan banyak yang gagal kemarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}KERONCONGAN…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh, enggak, aku kasih tahu orang-orang\Nkalau kita pacaran?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya aku mau kasih tahu semua orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma mau kasih tahu\Nteman-teman dekatku saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.95,0:20:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, dia rahasiakan ini buat aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira dia sudah kasih tahu teman-temannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, aku sudah kasih tahu Honchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak jago\Nsembunyikan sesuatu atau bohong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya aku gampang tertebak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa kubayangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa dimakan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kukis krim hias.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukis manis kayak begini benaran bisa dimakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu yang pertama kamu bilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jahat banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Susah banget gambarnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku usaha keras banget buat itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menurutku ini keren banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:21:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menatap…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah susah payah…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.87,0:22:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.46,0:22:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia berhasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya dia berhasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia gampang tertebak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus simpan selebaran kerja samanya, enggak?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.13,0:22:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buat referensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus kasih hadiah balasan, enggak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.59,0:22:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau dia cuma bercanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.89,0:22:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bertiga dapat masing-masing…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat Hari Valentine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu cuma bersihkan stok cacat, 'kan?
